Reading mu_2 and mu_4: their eigenvalues are purely imaginary (oscillation, no growth).
Forward Euler inflates an oscillation of frequency w by |1 + i w dt|, i.e. a spurious
rate of w^2 dt/2. Compare the measured slopes with that artefact:
